=== a block comment's interior lines keep their bytes when the code moves
context: expr
prefix: on:click={
suffix: }
--- input
            on:click={move |_| {
                    /* first
                     * second
                     */
                    go()
                }}
--- expected
            on:click={move |_| {
                /* first
                     * second
                     */
                go()
            }}
=== a line comment between arguments keeps the list broken
context: expr
prefix: aria-label={
suffix: }
--- input
            aria-label={tr(KEY, // the catalog key
                name)}
--- expected
            aria-label={tr(
                KEY, // the catalog key
                name
            )}
=== a multi-line string literal is copied exactly
context: expr
prefix: {
suffix: }
--- input
                {text(format!("first
  second {x}"),   size)}
--- expected
                {text(
                    format!(
                        "first
  second {x}"
                    ),
                    size
                )}
